Give me the list of permission in the service level which need to enable on IAM

The minimum role you normally need is:


| Role                                 | Purpose                                    | Where                     |
| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------- |
| `roles/secretmanager.secretAccessor` | Read secret values                         | Secret level              |
| `roles/iam.workloadIdentityUser`     | Allow GKE Kubernetes SA to use this GCP SA | GCP Service Account level |
